DESCRIPTION:Egemen Kolemen will talk about AI4Fusion and control.\n\n\nF
 rom: Arturo Dominguez <adomingu@pppl.gov>\nDate: Wednesday\, January 21\
 , 2026 at 8:31 PM\nTo: Tang\, Qi <qtang@gatech.edu>\nSubject: Invitation
 : AI4Fusion Colloquium Series: AI4Fusion: Possibilities an... @ Wed Jan 
 28\, 2026 4:15pm - 5:15pm (EST) (qtang@gatech.edu)\n\nYou don't often ge
 t email from adomingu@pppl.gov. Learn why this is important<https://aka.
 ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\n\nAI4Fusion Virtual Colloquium Serie
 s\n\n\n\nWednesday\, January 28th\, 4:15pm-5:15pm ET   (Note modified st
 art time)\n\nHosted by: Arturo Dominguez\n\nSpeaker:\n\nEgemen Kolemen -
  Professor at Princeton University’s Mechanical & Aerospace Engineering 
 Department\n\nTitle:  AI4Fusion: Possibilities and Applications in Enhan
 ced Diagnostics\, Control and Science Discovery\n\nAdvancements in AI ar
 e driving transformative progress in fusion energy. I will provide an ov
 erview and highlight the achievements of our group in this area: 1) Robu
 st plasma state prediction even when there is diagnostic failure 2) Find
 ing the minimal set of diagnostics needed to operate a reactor 3) Fusing
  data from multiple diagnostics (new Multimodal Super-Resolution techniq
 ue) to discover hidden physics insights 4) Prediction of plasma evolutio
 n in future fusion reactors such as ITER by combining experimental data 
 and simulations from multiple machines (DIII-D\, AUG\; ASTRA\, TRANSP\, 
 TGLF\,...) 5) Reinforcement learning control that achieves high performa
 nce fusion reactor operation without instabilities (tearing modes and EL
 Ms) both at KSTAR and DIII-D.\n\nI will then talk about our recent work 
 to push AI for fusion forward with foundation models\, AI-boosted diagno
 stics\, automated plasma analysis.\n\n\nFully virtual\n\nTo join\, you m
 ust REGISTER ON ZOOM<https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url
 =https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Furl%3Fq%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fpppl.zoom.
 us%252Fmeeting%252Fregister%252FE6Am8w66SwGjjpxpUdHvdQ%2523%252Fregistra
 tion%26sa%3DD%26source%3Dcalendar%26usd%3D2%26usg%3DAOvVaw0S8f3gEgbRugMI
 Oo_BonJ5&data=05%7C02%7Crzhangbq%40gatech.edu%7Ca1bc193de3ea4ec6c2e908de
 59646d91%7C482198bbae7b4b258b7a6d7f32faa083%7C1%7C0%7C639046485250128499
 %7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlA
 iOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=v3h8CFv
 q92ffXwloaiiQKn7ioIfsjv8m198kk8zSYZ4%3D&reserved=0>\n\nIf you've already
  registered\, use the personalized Zoom link emailed to you\n\n\nNote: M
 ost colloquiums are recorded (if the speaker consents). The video is typ
 ically available within one week of the presentation date and will be po
 sted to the AI4Fusion Colloquium Series<https://nam12.safelinks.protecti
 on.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Furl%3Fq%3Dhttps%253A%
