DESCRIPTION:Dear colleagues\,\nYou are invited to attend the MSc thesis 
 defense of Federico Preve:\n📅 Wednesday\, 26 November\n⏰ 11:00 AM\n📍 L
 ab Conference Room (Room 107)\nFederico will present his work on an adap
 ted active noise-cancellation circuit for double-beam laser absorption s
 pectroscopy\, demonstrating improved sensitivity and performance close t
 o commercial systems. His project includes circuit design\, PCB implemen
 tation\, and validation through water-vapor and ammonia absorption measu
 rements\, including shock-tube experiments.\nWe understand the defense f
 alls the day before Thanksgiving and some of you may be unavailable\, bu
 t your presence would be greatly appreciated.\nWe hope to see you there!
 \n\n\n__________________________________________________________________
