DESCRIPTION:Some people who received this message don't often get email 
 from cheung26@llnl.gov. Learn why this is important<https://aka.ms/Learn
 AboutSenderIdentification>\n\nWhen: Thursday\, October 30\, 2025\, 11:00
  AM-12:00 PM (UTC-08:00) Pacific Time (US & Canada)\n\nWhere: https://ll
 nlfed.webex.com/llnlfed/j.php?MTID=m54647e3719c89c970f06b9f5f3c36116<htt
 ps://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fllnlfed.w
