DESCRIPTION:You don't often get email from cheung26@llnl.gov. Learn why 
 this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\n\nWhen
 : Thursday\, October 23\, 2025\, 11:00 AM-12:00 PM  (UTC-08:00) Pacific 
 Time (US & Canada)\n\nWhere: https://llnlfed.webex.com/llnlfed/j.php?MTI
 D=m82062c675cf6e21eab507ac1c68b3d19<https://nam12.safelinks.protection.o
 utlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fllnlfed.webex.com%2Fllnlfed%2Fj.php%3FMTID
 %3Dm82062c675cf6e21eab507ac1c68b3d19&data=05%7C02%7Crzhangbq%40gatech.ed
