 \nI will go over the program and institute requirements in detail and th
 ere will be time for questions. These sessions are not designed to be on
 e-on-one advising sessions\, so I will not be able to answer questions s
 pecific to an individual's situation due to privacy regulations. If your
  question is not answered\, then this may be addressed one-on-one separa
 tely via email or meeting.\n\n__________________________________________
