DESCRIPTION:Hello CoC Community\,\n\nWe’re excited to announce our next 
 TSO research team office hours on-site in KACB. This is a great opportun
 ity to get direct\, in-person support for any Research IT-related questi
 ons or issues. No appointment is necessary—just drop by! Feel free to co
 me say hi even if you don’t need any support.\n\nIf you can’t make it\, 
 don’t worry.  We will see you next month in CODA.\nDetails:\n\n  *   Dat
 e: 06/25/25\n  *   Time: 9am to 4pm\n  *   Location: 2100\, 2nd Floor\, 
 KACB\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\n--\n\nDavid Mercer\nAsso
 ciate Director of Research and Instruction\nTechnology Services Organiza
 tion\nCollege of Computing at Georgia Tech\n\n\n
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250625T160000
