DESCRIPTION:Hello CoC Community\,\n\nWe’re excited to announce our May T
 SO research team office hours on-site in CODA. This is a great opportuni
 ty to get direct\, in-person support for any Research IT-related questio
 ns or issues. No appointment is necessary—just drop by! Feel free to com
 e say hi even if you don’t need any support.\n\nIf you can’t make it\, d
 on’t worry.  We will see you next month in KACB.\nDetails:\n\n  *   Date
 : 05/28/25\n  *   Time: 9am to 4pm\n  *   Location: C1103 Lindberg\, 11t
 h Floor\, CODA\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\n--\n\nDavid Me
 rcer\nAssociate Director of Research and Instruction\nTechnology Service
 s Organization\nCollege of Computing at Georgia Tech\n
