DESCRIPTION:In case you will be interested. It is on Hamiltonian preserv
 ation super particle formulation for Vlasov-Poisson.\n\n\n\nFrom: qtang@
 gatech.edu\nWhen: 10:00 AM - 11:00 AM February 28\, 2025\nSubject: Mande
 la\n\n\nDear all\,\n\nMandela Quashie will give his practice talk for th
 e upcoming SIAM CSE. He will talk about our super particle formulation a
 nd the recent numerical results. Please feel free to join in. See the zo
 om invite below.\n\nJoin Zoom Meeting\nhttps://msu.zoom.us/j/92344508031
 \n\nMeeting ID: 923 4450 8031\nPasscode: 2025\n\nBest\,\nQi\n
