DESCRIPTION:8/28- Dean Sarkar has decided to shift the Fall 2025 virtual
  office hours from a weekly to a bi-weekly schedule\, starting September
  5.\nAs a result\, there will be no meeting tomorrow\, August 29. Thank 
 you.\n\n8/25/25- The Dean’s Fall 2025 weekly virtual office hours start 
 August 29\, from 1–2 PM. Please note that these dates and times may chan
 ge or be canceled depending on the Dean’s availability. Any updates will
  be communicated in advance via the meeting invite. Thank you.\n\n5/8/25
 -CB has scheduled the Dean’s Summer 2025 bi-weekly virtual office hours 
 for Fridays from 1:00 to 2:00 PM EST starting May 9. This proposed date 
 and time may change or be canceled depending on the Dean’s schedule\, bu
 t everyone will be notified in advance through their meeting invite. Tha
 nk you.\n\nVirtual only\n\nSummer 2025 timeline: Bi-weekly on Fridays fr
 om 1:00-2:00 pm EST\, starting 5/9 – 7/25 \, thanks.    *****The Fall 20
 25 weekly series will start August 29. [CB updated\, 8/25]\n\n2/19- CB p
 laced on the calendar- Spring 2025- weekly virtual office hours- Every T
 hursday from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; tha
 nks\n\nVirtual only\nTimeline: Every Thursday from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm 
 EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks.\n____________________________
