 -weekly schedule\, starting September 5.\nAs a result\, there will be no
  meeting tomorrow\, August 29. Thank you.\n\n8/25/25- The Dean’s Fall 20
 25 weekly virtual office hours start August 29\, from 1–2 PM. Please not
 e that these dates and times may change or be canceled depending on the 
 Dean’s availability. Any updates will be communicated in advance via the
  meeting invite. Thank you.\n\n5/8/25-CB has scheduled the Dean’s Summer
