DESCRIPTION:9/16- Per Vivek's request\, this virtual meeting has been re
 scheduled from Friday\, September 19\, to Monday\, September 22. Thank y
 ou.\n8/28- Dean Sarkar has decided to shift the Fall 2025 virtual office
  hours from a weekly to a bi-weekly schedule\, starting September 5.\nAs
  a result\, there will be no meeting tomorrow\, August 29. Thank you.\n\
 n8/25/25- The Dean’s Fall 2025 weekly virtual office hours start August 
 29\, from 1–2 PM. Please note that these dates and times may change or b
 e canceled depending on the Dean’s availability. Any updates will be com
 municated in advance via the meeting invite. Thank you.\n\n5/8/25-CB has
  scheduled the Dean’s Summer 2025 bi-weekly virtual office hours for Fri
 days from 1:00 to 2:00 PM EST starting May 9. This proposed date and tim
 e may change or be canceled depending on the Dean’s schedule\, but every
 one will be notified in advance through their meeting invite. Thank you.
 \n\nVirtual only\n\nSummer 2025 timeline: Bi-weekly on Fridays from 1:00
 -2:00 pm EST\, starting 5/9 – 7/25 \, thanks.    *****The Fall 2025 week
 ly series will start August 29. [CB updated\, 8/25]\n\n2/19- CB placed o
 n the calendar- Spring 2025- weekly virtual office hours- Every Thursday
  from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks\n\n
 Virtual only\nTimeline: Every Thursday from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, s
 tarting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks.\n___________________________________
