 IlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=wYWp
 GZ00fjgstD1EzvySASIJ3LjQYquEDIMYENmxZVU%3D&reserved=0>\n\nExpanding its 
 course selections and deepening our relationship with CREATE-X: https://
 www.cc.gatech.edu/news/college-expands-partnership-create-x-double-down-
 entrepreneurship-curriculum<https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.c
 om/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cc.gatech.edu%2Fnews%2Fcollege-expands-partner
 ship-create-x-double-down-entrepreneurship-curriculum&data=05%7C02%7Crzh
