DESCRIPTION:10/16 – Tomorrow’s meeting has been canceled at Dean Sarkar’
 s request. Thank you.\n8/28- Dean Sarkar has decided to shift the Fall 2
 025 virtual office hours from a weekly to a bi-weekly schedule\, startin
 g September 5.\nAs a result\, there will be no meeting tomorrow\, August
  29. Thank you.\n\n8/25/25- The Dean’s Fall 2025 weekly virtual office h
 ours start August 29\, from 1–2 PM. Please note that these dates and tim
 es may change or be canceled depending on the Dean’s availability. Any u
 pdates will be communicated in advance via the meeting invite. Thank you
 .\n\n5/8/25-CB has scheduled the Dean’s Summer 2025 bi-weekly virtual of
 fice hours for Fridays from 1:00 to 2:00 PM EST starting May 9. This pro
 posed date and time may change or be canceled depending on the Dean’s sc
 hedule\, but everyone will be notified in advance through their meeting 
 invite. Thank you.\n\nVirtual only\n\nSummer 2025 timeline: Bi-weekly on
  Fridays from 1:00-2:00 pm EST\, starting 5/9 – 7/25 \, thanks.    *****
 The Fall 2025 weekly series will start August 29. [CB updated\, 8/25]\n\
 n2/19- CB placed on the calendar- Spring 2025- weekly virtual office hou
 rs- Every Thursday from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24
 /2025\; thanks\n\nVirtual only\nTimeline: Every Thursday from 11:30 am t
 o 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks.\n_________________
