DESCRIPTION:\n11/13- "As requested by Dean Sarkar\,  tomorrow’s meeting 
 scheduled for November 14 has been moved to November 21. Thank you."\n\n
 8/28- Dean Sarkar has decided to shift the Fall 2025 virtual office hour
 s from a weekly to a bi-weekly schedule\, starting September 5.\n\nAs a 
 result\, there will be no meeting tomorrow\, August 29. Thank you.\n\n\n
 \n8/25/25- The Dean’s Fall 2025 weekly virtual office hours start August
  29\, from 1–2 PM. Please note that these dates and times may change or 
 be canceled depending on the Dean’s availability. Any updates will be co
 mmunicated in advance via the meeting invite. Thank you.\n\n\n\n5/8/25-C
 B has scheduled the Dean’s Summer 2025 bi-weekly virtual office hours fo
 r Fridays from 1:00 to 2:00 PM EST starting May 9. This proposed date an
 d time may change or be canceled depending on the Dean’s schedule\, but 
 everyone will be notified in advance through their meeting invite. Thank
  you.\n\n\n\nVirtual only\n\n\n\nSummer 2025 timeline: Bi-weekly on Frid
 ays from 1:00-2:00 pm EST\, starting 5/9 – 7/25 \, thanks.    *****The F
 all 2025 weekly series will start August 29. [CB updated\, 8/25]\n\n\n\n
 2/19- CB placed on the calendar- Spring 2025- weekly virtual office hour
 s- Every Thursday from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/
 2025\; thanks\n\n\n\nVirtual only\n\nTimeline: Every Thursday from 11:30
  am to 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks.\n\n__________
