DESCRIPTION:11/21 – Please note that\, in observance of the Thanksgiving
  holiday on November 28\, the Dean’s virtual office hour meeting has bee
 n rescheduled to December 5 from 2:30–3:30 pm. This will be the final me
 eting of the fall semester. Bi-weekly virtual office hours will resume o
 n Friday\, January 16\, 2026. Thank you.\n\n\n8/28- Dean Sarkar has deci
 ded to shift the Fall 2025 virtual office hours from a weekly to a bi-we
 ekly schedule\, starting September 5.\n\nAs a result\, there will be no 
 meeting tomorrow\, August 29. Thank you.\n\n\n\n8/25/25- The Dean’s Fall
  2025 weekly virtual office hours start August 29\, from 1–2 PM. Please 
 note that these dates and times may change or be canceled depending on t
 he Dean’s availability. Any updates will be communicated in advance via 
 the meeting invite. Thank you.\n\n\n\n5/8/25-CB has scheduled the Dean’s
  Summer 2025 bi-weekly virtual office hours for Fridays from 1:00 to 2:0
 0 PM EST starting May 9. This proposed date and time may change or be ca
 nceled depending on the Dean’s schedule\, but everyone will be notified 
 in advance through their meeting invite. Thank you.\n\n\n\nVirtual only\
 n\n\n\nSummer 2025 timeline: Bi-weekly on Fridays from 1:00-2:00 pm EST\
 , starting 5/9 – 7/25 \, thanks.    *****The Fall 2025 weekly series wil
 l start August 29. [CB updated\, 8/25]\n\n\n\n2/19- CB placed on the cal
 endar- Spring 2025- weekly virtual office hours- Every Thursday from 11:
 30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, starting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks\n\n\n\nVirtu
 al only\n\nTimeline: Every Thursday from 11:30 am to 12:30 pm EST\, star
 ting 2/20 to 4/24/2025\; thanks.\n\n____________________________________
