DESCRIPTION:Good afternoon\, CSE Faculty and PhD Students\,\nI hope you 
 all are doing well. As part of Dean Vivek Sarkar’s ongoing efforts to en
 gage with the community and address concerns\, there will be an in-perso
 n Listening Session held this week.\nDate: Thursday\, February 6th\, 202
 5\nTime: 9:00 AM - 10:00 AM\nLocation: CSE CODA Workshop Room\nThis sess
 ion will provide an opportunity for you to share your thoughts\, ideas\,
  and concerns directly with Dean Sarkar. Your input will help the leader
 ship in providing more informed support and guidance. Unfortunately\, th
 ere will be no virtual option for this listening session. So\, we encour
 age everyone to attend in person if possible.\nWe look forward to seeing
  you at the session!\nBest\,\nMary\n\n
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250206T100000
