  1 week due to weather conditions. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n
 Hello CoC Community\,\n\nWe’re excited to announce our next TSO research
  team office hours on-site at CODA. This is a great opportunity to get d
 irect\, in-person support for any Research IT-related questions or issue
 s. No appointment is necessary—just drop by! Feel free to come say hi ev
 en if you don’t need any support.\n\nIf you can’t make it\, don’t worry.
   We will see you next month in TSRB.\nDetails:\n\n  *   Date: 01/22/24\
 n  *   Time: 9am to 4pm\n  *   Location: C1103 Lindberg Conference Room\
 , 11th Floor\, CODA\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\n--\n\nDav
 id Mercer\nAssociate Director of Research and Instruction\nTechnology Se
 rvices Organization\nCollege of Computing at Georgia Tech\n
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250129T160000
DTSTAMP:20260126T030608Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250129T114500
LOCATION:Coda C1103 Lindberg
ORGANIZER;CN="Mercer, David";EMAIL="david.mercer@cc.gatech.edu":mailto:d
 avid.mercer@cc.gatech.edu
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Postponed: TSO Research Team Office Hours
