DESCRIPTION:Free coffee and snacks for CSE staff\, faculty\, and student
 s! Hosted by CSE Graduate Student Association https://www.cse.gatech.edu
 /cse-graduate-student-association\n\nThe CSE CODA Workshop Room is locat
 ed in the13th floor of CODA across from the kitchen. Those without CODA 
 building access can meet at the second-floor elevators at 2:50 PM to go 
 up.\n
